<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Inland Resources started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Inland Resources started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ladenburg Thalmann said it initiated coverage of Inland Resources Inc with a long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Set an 12-to-18-month price target of $15 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Shares were not immediately open Wednesday after closing Tuesday at nine.</p>
</text>
